filtered.bin is a derived, luminance-neutral product studio: nine GGX roughness
levels (1024 x 512 down to 4 x 2) followed by 64 x 32 diffuse irradiance
divided by pi, packed RGBA float32 (little endian). Filtering and neutralisation run on Vulkan; the original HDR
is retained so this asset can be reproduced:

cargo run --offline -p veylvik-io --example environment_map -- \
  crates/veylvik-render/assets/studio/ferndale_studio_09_1k.hdr \
  crates/veylvik-render/assets/studio/filtered.bin --neutral
